{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112632","id":2997782779,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6yroj7","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112632","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112632.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112632.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112632","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112632/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112632/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112632/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/31679ccd98c8a1ddc4df8355719206032190a3de","number":112632,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Fix PackedScene instantiate losing collection types if property default is NIL","user":{"login":"kevinlam508","id":14243263,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0MjQzMjYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14243263?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevinlam508","html_url":"https://github.com/kevinlam508","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevinlam508/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevinlam508/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevinlam508/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevinlam508/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevinlam508/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevinlam508/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevinlam508/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevinlam508/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevinlam508/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Fixes #97850\r\nFixes #91428\r\nFixes #101801\r\nFixes #117632\r\nSupersedes #98546\r\n\r\nThese changes ensure both array and dictionary types are correctly set regardless of what `get` returns by setting types based on the property hint string. Technically these bugs were possible without C# scripts depending on property defaults, C# scripts are just the most user facing way to encounter this.\r\n\r\nThese changes fix duplication and instantiation bugs because the checks around correctly maintaining node references depend on having the correct collection types.\r\n\r\n## Parsing behavior\r\n\r\nThe property hint string parsing behaves slightly differently for `PackedScene` since it now handles missing \":\" or \";\" cases to match `EditorPropertyArray` and `EditorPropertyDictionary` which can be updated to use `PropertyUtils::parse_*_hint_string` after this PR so everything is consistent.\r\n<details>\r\n\r\n<summary>Parsing behavior reference</summary>\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/8327dfa215aa1758f2c3b99a52934172b94c134e/editor/inspector/editor_properties_array_dict.cpp#L854-L881\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/8327dfa215aa1758f2c3b99a52934172b94c134e/editor/inspector/editor_properties_array_dict.cpp#L1157-L1214\r\n\r\n</details>\r\n\r\n## Loading and assigning the script type\r\n\r\nAssigning the script resource was needed at least for dictionaries to property assign the native class type for these checks:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/8327dfa215aa1758f2c3b99a52934172b94c134e/scene/resources/packed_scene.cpp#L620-L623\r\n\r\nBut I'm not sure how important doing so for arrays since `EditorPropertyArray` does not, but I think the equivalent property in GDScript does set the script type.\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/8327dfa215aa1758f2c3b99a52934172b94c134e/editor/inspector/editor_properties_array_dict.cpp#L236-L251\r\n\r\n## Getting the property hint\r\n\r\nI couldn't find a faster way to get the property hint for an individual property since there's only functions to grab the whole list, but at least the property list is only grabbed at most twice per node instead of once per node collection property.\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch in priority.\r\n\r\nRelevant fixes are cherry-picked for stable branches as needed by maintainers.\r\n\r\nTo speed up the contribution process and avoid CI errors, please set up pre-commit hooks locally:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/engine/guidelines/code_style.html\r\n-->\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/